A split infers the new units' total basis from the units they replace, without a trade price.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight transactions --format text

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity FUND
  format 1,000 FUND
account Assets:Fund
account Assets:Cash

2024-01-01 Purchase
  Assets:Fund  2 FUND {100 SEK}
  Assets:Cash  -200 SEK

2024-01-02 Two-for-one split
  Assets:Fund  -2 FUND {{200 SEK}}
  Assets:Fund  4 FUND

========== OUTPUT ==========

2024-01-01 Purchase
    Assets:Fund                         2 FUND {100.00 SEK}
    Assets:Cash                          -200.00 SEK

2024-01-02 Two-for-one split
    Assets:Fund                         -2 FUND {100.00 SEK}
    Assets:Fund                         4 FUND {50.00 SEK}

========== WARNINGS ==========
